dxt embeds this browser to support dbt-compatible documentation artifacts.
The native runtime changes the displayed page title and logo to dxt, supplies a
local favicon, defers interpolated icon URLs until Angular resolves them, and
optionally inlines generated artifacts for offline viewing. The vendored file is
unchanged.
dxt is an independent project and is not affiliated with dbt Labs.
